hi I'm Evan Carmichael welcome to  another edition of ask Evan today  mention the question from one of our  readers Albert who had a question about  network marketing so wrote in saying  dear Evan thank you for the great  business ideas however I have a question  I'm in network marketing people always  say to me that network marketing doesn't  work please help me show ways that I can  succeed in network marketing improve the  people that it works so thanks for the  question Albert for those are you  watching who are in network marketing or  thinking about it if you want to prove  that it works the first way to do it is  go and do it yourself you know it's  building the network marketing business  is mostly about getting a downline right  getting people under you who can sell  usually don't make as much commission  yourself it's hard to build a real  network marketing business with just you  selling it's more about getting the  people in your downline in place but to  make that work you have to show that you  can actually go out and sell right it's  going to be hard for you to convince you  know 100 people that sign up in your  downline and actually be effective at  selling if you haven't gone out and done  it yourself is shown that it works right  so that's step one is you figuring out  the model you may not make a lot of  money going out and making these sales  you know the bigger money is in the  downline but to be able to get good  people in your downline it's going to  come from showing that you can make a  living from actually selling the  products so first step is actually doing  it yourself if you need help in getting  there I would try to find a mentor I try  to find somebody within your  organization maybe the person who  brought you in or maybe somebody above  them where there's some kind of  incentive for them to help you look at  how they've built their business what  success is a pad and try to model it and  use their strategies nothing to help  yourself but to help the people who come  in under you but that's the key because  if you don't have any success yourself  you could bring people into your  downline it's not about the number of  people in your downline it's more about  the quality you can sign people up but  they're not going to be high quality  people right you want people who are  seriously committed to it who want to  make this their full-time business and  and grow it and be massive  successful at it it's going to come from  people who really give it a good thought  right people who do their research  people who are committed to it and  somebody who's really good it's probably  not going to sign up for a program from  somebody who hasn't had any success with  it right so it's not about getting a  thousand people who never sell anything  for you you want the fewer people who  will actually go out and build something  out of it so if you were trying to  convince me for example to join the  network marketing business I'd really  want to look at it and see what have you  done what success if you had doing it so  first step is you got to go out and  prove it yourself you got to be able to  go out make sales and show that this is  a viable business that you know you're  excited about the next thing I'd say is  a lot of network marketing businesses  fail because the people aren't  passionate about the products you're  just trying to go out and make a buck  and that's that's always a terrible way  to try to start a business yes you want  to make money it's important right we're  not running charities here running the  business we have to feed our families we  got to put food on the table but the  main goal of running the business  shouldn't be just to make money you  should do something because you're  really passionate about it and you want  to help people so that's true of any  business not just network marketing so  you have to ask yourself are you really  passionate about this product or service  that you're selling through your network  marketing and if yes then a great way to  be able to sell is to tell your story  right why are you so excited about this  product that's being created are you  using it are you getting personal  benefits from it have you helped people  personally that you can really explain  their stories because that's the kind of  stuff that sells very well and if you're  behind it and you're excited about it  you're passionate about it that's going  to come through and people are going to  want to sign up for you if it's just  something here is an opportunity to make  money and you're not you know it's super  passion but the product or service it's  going to be hard to get customers on  board and it's going to be hard to get a  downline on board so it's not  necessarily anything wrong with network  marketing as a business model it's  making sure that you strongly believe in  the product or services being offered so  that when you're selling it it's a lot  more credible than otherwise would be  so those would be my you know first key  points if you want to show that it works  do it yourself you know build up a core  business if you need help doing that I'd  look to your upline and try to find the  mentor and try to learn how they did it  and share their stories but then also in  terms of work marketing in general you  want to make sure that you're really  passionate about it you believe in a  parking service you use it yourself  you've seen the benefits you can tell  your own personal stories about it  that's going to get people excited the  last book thing about no marketing is  people come in very often trying to make  a quick buck and they get all excited  about the pitch and whatever videos  you're showing them and all the  materials that come from head office but  it can be hard to make that first sale  and so you want to try to get them  involved and coach them and help them as  much as possible so that they can get to  that survival points they're making  their first sales or making a little bit  of money they have a taste they've  gotten beyond their comfort zone a  little bit and so I would invest more of  my time in trying to find really good  quality downline people and train them  and work with them and coach them and no  keep on top of them every week and touch  base with them and be a mentor and  support them as much as you can at least  until they get to the point of survival  where they've committed to this thing  just so that you don't keep churning out  really bad people who never go anywhere  with it and give it a try for a week and  say it's not for them and you're just  spinning your wheels so I'd focus on you  know fewer quantity of people higher  quality and then invest your time into  training them and making sure that they  really understand how to get this  business going and support them because  it's tough and if you've gone through it  you can relate right if you started this  business yourself and you went through  the first couple months and didn't make  a sale and then finally you made your  first sale and another one and then  another one that's a story you can  relate to them and they want to  hopefully emulate your success and do  something along the same lines for  themselves so hopefully that helps out  for a great question for those of you  watching if you liked the video please  give it a thumbs up makes want to do  more for you and if you ever thought  about this video or network marketing or  if you have a question about your  business that you want me to answer  goofy leave in the comments section  below I always read those I love  come in and hope you'll be able to  answer question for you in the near  future so thank you and we'll see you on  the next episode
 

